# DVN Intelligence Tool - Complete Testing & Implementation Guide

## PROJECT OVERVIEW

**Name:** DVN Intelligence Platform  
**Purpose:** Analytics and marketplace for institutional builders evaluating Data Verification Networks (DVNs) on LayerZero protocol  
**Target Users:**
1. Institutional builders selecting DVN stacks for new OApps (RWAs, stablecoins)
2. Institutional compliance teams monitoring OApp performance and generating reports

**Core Value:** First tool to aggregate DVN performance metrics across LayerZero with institutional-grade compliance reporting

